            "review_title": "Review at Bun Rieu Ganh",
            "review_text": "Gretta H\n6 contributions\n0\nA surprising delight\nMar 2024 • Family\nWe came upon this place completely by accident and had the Bun Rieu because that is what all the locals that filled the restaurant were having- surprisingly delicious. So glad we looked away from the places filled with tourists to eat here- planning to return for another meal before leaving the city. Staff very pleasant, quick service, very reasonably priced.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 9, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
