            "review_text": "jwidjj\nJakarta, Indonesia731 contributions\n0\nVietnamese Vermicelli Soup\nNov 2022 • Friends\nDidn't think we would like this dish. It's basically vermicelli in orange colored clear broth with minced pork, tomatoes with a side of fresh herbs. The taste was suprisingly fresh and savoury. The price is reasonable. Tried the pennywort with coconut drink. Very refreshing. The establishment is clean and comfy. Service is fast and friendly. Located close to Benh Tanh market.\nRead more\nWritten November 28, 2022",
