            "review_title": "Review at Bun Rieu Ganh",
            "review_text": "Minh D\nPhu Huu, Vietnam3 contributions\n1\nNot really excellent\nAug 2018 • Solo\nThis place is well known because of it's location: just right beside Ben Thanh market. From a local's perspective I don't think this place offers the best bun rieu in town. Some better alternatives IMHO: Bún Riêu Nhà at 19E Kỳ Đồng, district 3 (about 2.5km from this place): bigger bowl and better taste; Bún riêu cua ốc at 66 Nguyễn Thái Bình, district 1 (about 500m from this place)\n\nDisclaimer: I don't have any relationship with the two listed places above\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 3, 2018",
