            "review_title": "Review at Bun Rieu Ganh",
            "review_text": "QA P\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam135 contributions\n0\nAuthentic 'Bun rieu'!\nJan 2018 • Friends\nVery single minded place, selling only one dish 'Bún riêu' (noodle soup with pond crabs) yet it has been my place for the last 10 years. \nIt is now having a new face, moved to indoor, looking a bit more fancy comparing to street vendor of the past, cooler with more comfortable sitting, thanks to the 'street clean up' movement of the city I suppose, but somehow I miss so much the feeling of 'street food', of eating on the pavement after work. \nThe good thing is that their quality hasn't changed at all, doesn't matter wherever they are.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 7, 2018",
