            "review_text": "Lieu N\nGreat Falls, Virginia44 contributions\n0\nCheap Eat, Fast and Fabulous!!\nDec 2017 • Friends\nI was referred to this noodle place a little more than a year ago. They serve only 1 thing here, it's \"bun rieu\" noodle soup. You will be sitting on a plastic stool close to the floor with a small table. Ask for cooked vegetables and put the vegetables in your bowl of noodle soup. It's amazingly good!! I always make a few stops to Bun Rieu Ganh each time I go to Saigon.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 21, 2017",
